pletion D.host.E) → ℂ) = om μw g h Φ → ∀ a c', Θ.Λ (ι Φ') (T' (twist πl (detChar (Fin D.R.nV) ηw) h a)) (T'' (σl g c')) = Θ.Λ (ι Φ) (T' a) (T'' c') := by
  atlas_forward_decl GlobalTheory.ThetaLocInv.thetaRead_inv
